      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_entry_must_match_live_xref_slot_before_clear",
      "fine_trace_step": 15,
      "description": "The function keeps `entry` live across `shift(\"endstream\", objNum)`, even though that scan can reconstruct the xref through `Lexer::getObj -> XRef::getNumEntry -> XRef::getEntry -> XRef::readXRefUntil`. At cleanup it only checks non-nullness instead of reacquiring `xref->getEntry(objNum, false)` from the rebuilt table."
